ph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-yang:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-yang","quote":"羕"},{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-yang:p002:m0271","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-yang:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-yang","quote":"羕"},{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-zong:p001:m0049","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-zong:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-zong","quote":"羕"}],"identity_note":"卷059固定見證本地人物；未按同名跨史合併。","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAC","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","source_assertion_id":"a-jinshu059-羕-father-亮","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-liang-yang","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line024","quote":"及武帝寢疾，為楊駿所排，乃以亮為侍中、大司馬、假黃鉞、大都督、督豫州諸軍事，出鎮許昌，加軒懸之樂，六佾之舞。封子羕為西陽公。未發，帝大漸，詔留亮委以後事。楊駿聞之，從中書監華暠索詔視，遂不還。帝崩，亮懼駿疑己，辭疾不入，于大司馬門外敘哀而已，表求過葬。駿欲討亮，亮知之，問計于廷尉何勖。勖曰：「今朝廷皆歸心於公，公何不討人而懼為人所討！」或說亮率所領入廢駿，亮不能用，夜馳赴許昌，故得免。及駿誅，詔曰：「大司馬、汝南王亮體道沖粹，通識政理，宣翼之績，顯於本朝，《二南》之風，流于方夏，將憑遠猷，以康王化。其以亮為太宰、錄尚書事，入朝不趨，劍履上殿，增掾屬十人，給千兵百騎，與太保衛瓘對掌朝政。」亮論賞誅楊駿之功過差，欲以苟悅眾心，由是失望。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line024:m0056","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line024:m0014"}],"interpretation_note":"先存具名父子／孫系來源，再提出家族路徑；未知中間父親不造人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}},{"id":"gd5_5ua_e0a","label":"司馬播〔西陽王羕世子〕","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"播","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-059-liang-son-yang:p002:m0246"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-yang:p002:m0246","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-yang:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-yang","quote":"播"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"司馬播〔西陽王羕世子〕，見本組原文及身份互校。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-jinshu-059-liang-son-yang-ws2650517","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-s